        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 041, Traditional Mortise Deadbolt Lock Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Traditional Mortise Single Cylinder Deadbolt from Omnia features a traditional style interior turnpiece and minimalist low profile exterior lock. The exterior mortise lock cylinder is solid brass and Made in the USA with a Schlage \"C\" 5 pin keyway. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The mortise deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C10PC1_size.gif?v=1704354707\" width=\"327\" height=\"289\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia 041M Modern Mortise Deadbolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 041 Traditional Mortise Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C, 5-pin</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: 1 cylinder with collar, 1 thumbturn, mortise box assembly, faceplate, strike, and dust box.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Mortise Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case: 4\" x 3\"h x 7/8\". Heavy weight steel. Zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: select 1-3/4\" to 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Stile: 4-1/2\" minimum required.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt : Stainless steel 5/8\" x 1-1/16\" with a 1\" throw.</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate: 1-1/8\"w x 4-5/8\"h from brass or stainless steel. Armored Front, Adjustable steel front.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1-1/8\"w x 3-1/2\"h from brass or stainless steel.</li>\r\n<li>Case Springs: High carbon steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/041-Deadlock-Template.pdf?v=1704262338\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia 041 Mortise Lock Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-starfish-nickel.jpg?v=1704354584\" width=\"513\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
